  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Biodiversity For All</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">B4A addresses biodiversity loss from deforestation across Prey Lang, Preah Rokar, and Sorng Rokha Vorn Wildlife Sanctuaries via three interconnected pathways: prevention through strengthened community-based forest monitoring that integrates the Prey Lang App with Indigenous knowledge to reduce illegal logging and improve enforcement; resilience through diversified livelihoods to reduce pressure on forest resources; and participation by enabling women, youth, Indigenous elders, and faith actors to influence biodiversity policy processes, including the NBSAP and KM-GBF.</narrative>
  </description>
